This is a live system that can install Linux to your hard drive.

🚀 Automatic Installation:
   This system automatically installs to hard drive on boot

🤖 Installation process:
   - Detects largest available disk (minimum 8GB)
   - Automatically partitions and installs system
   - Reboots when complete

🔍 To check available disks:
   lsblk                    (list all block devices)
   sudo fdisk -l           (show detailed disk info)

🔑 Login accounts:
   installer / installer   (has sudo access)
   root / root            (full access)

📚 Useful commands:
   nano /path/file        (edit files)
   systemctl status       (check services)
   ip addr show          (network info)
